WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.465
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.660
Today I'll show you how to
deploy NGINX Plus in Google

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.130
Cloud launcher.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.770
NGINX Plus is a complete
application delivery platform

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:18.060
combining load balancing,
content caching, web server,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:21.470
security controls,
and monitoring.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:25.730
In cloud launcher type and NGINX
in the search bar and select

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.630
NGINX plus from the results.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:32.150
Click launch on
Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:35.150
Select the project where you
want to deploy NGINX Plus

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.960
and click continue.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.890
Next configure the name
and other parameters

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.560
for a new instance.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.350
Click Deploy.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.460
An instance with the latest
version of NGINX Plus

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.880
will deploy.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.430
To learn more about
NGINX configuration

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:53.590
and activate support,
click Getting Started,

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:56.730
and go to NGINX Support.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:00.290
To get started with NGINX
Plus on cloud launcher,

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.530
click on the link
in the comments.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.540
Thanks for watching.

